    "sections": {
        "description": "bBlocks is a multipurpose block theme made for the Site Editor and full site editing with WordPress core blocks. Its clean design system and flexible color styles suit almost any website: business and corporate, creative agency, SaaS and startup, architecture and real estate, spa and beauty salon, hotel and resort, consulting and coaching, theme marketplace, portfolio or blog. Nine one-click starter sites and 76 ready-made patterns cover every page, from hero, features, services and pricing sections to team, testimonials, FAQ, portfolio and contact. Eight style variations and self-hosted fonts make it easy to match your brand in a click, while optional modules add dark mode, a smart sticky header, scroll animations and floating contact buttons. bBlocks needs no page builder, works with WooCommerce, supports RTL languages and is fully translation-ready. Whether you are launching your first website or redesigning an established one, bBlocks is a fast, versatile foundation for building with WordPress."
    },
